        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits. Fly closer. Score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare Up: Adrenaline is an arcade wingsuit base-jumping game where skill, precision, and guts define the best base jumpers in the world. The closer you fly to cliffs, trees, and obstacles, the more points you earn — but one wrong move, and you’ll crash hard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Wingsuit Flight:</strong> <br>Experience fast-paced, low-altitude flying across stunning open environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/32b07ba00bbc121462f651a87ce51fdc.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Scoring:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you fly to the ground, the bigger your multiplier — risk it all for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/add10c25557c4d7fa59c2e71b7d77dd2.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or compete with the world to claim your place among the Top 10 daredevils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/563649ba53e2ce5c1394d96d647eceb2.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Events:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings new challenges, new locations, and fresh rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/a8302ab368c2026a01d230d922d0e768.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Wingsuits:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new wingsuit designs and show off your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1765182578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1765182578 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay System:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the pros earn their massive scores and learn new lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1765182578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1765182578 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crash Physics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly too close, and the mountain will remind you who’s boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Arcade eSport</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just another flying game — Dare Up: Adrenaline is a competitive eSport experience, designed for players who crave speed, precision, and bragging rights. Every flight is a dare — and only the best make it to the podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do You Dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season, new terrains appear and the leaderboard resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So… how close will you fly?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits. Fly closer. Score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare Up: Adrenaline is an arcade wingsuit base-jumping game where skill, precision, and guts define the best base jumpers in the world. The closer you fly to cliffs, trees, and obstacles, the more points you earn — but one wrong move, and you’ll crash hard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Wingsuit Flight:</strong> <br>Experience fast-paced, low-altitude flying across stunning open environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/32b07ba00bbc121462f651a87ce51fdc.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Scoring:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you fly to the ground, the bigger your multiplier — risk it all for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/add10c25557c4d7fa59c2e71b7d77dd2.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or compete with the world to claim your place among the Top 10 daredevils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/563649ba53e2ce5c1394d96d647eceb2.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Events:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings new challenges, new locations, and fresh rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/a8302ab368c2026a01d230d922d0e768.avif?t=1765182578\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Wingsuits:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new wingsuit designs and show off your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1765182578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1765182578 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay System:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the pros earn their massive scores and learn new lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1765182578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1765182578 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crash Physics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly too close, and the mountain will remind you who’s boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Arcade eSport</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just another flying game — Dare Up: Adrenaline is a competitive eSport experience, designed for players who crave speed, precision, and bragging rights. Every flight is a dare — and only the best make it to the podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do You Dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season, new terrains appear and the leaderboard resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So… how close will you fly?</p>",
